WEBVTT

00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:37.070
<i>ENTER THE RED DOORS</i>

00:00:50.420 --> 00:00:57.680
<i>Up above the forest of slumber</i>

00:00:57.680 --> 00:01:04.350
<i>Two moons look down from the sky</i>

00:01:04.350 --> 00:01:11.860
<i>Where did you come from,</i>
<i>and where are you going?</i>

00:01:11.860 --> 00:01:20.240
<i>Where are we going?</i>

00:01:22.120 --> 00:01:25.870
<i>ENTER THE RED DOORS</i>

00:02:13.250 --> 00:02:15.840
Stop... Stop, help!

00:02:15.840 --> 00:02:20.300
Everyone said that. Everyone.

00:02:21.300 --> 00:02:24.810
They all said, "Help."

00:02:24.810 --> 00:02:27.430
But you smiled.

00:02:27.430 --> 00:02:31.650
Opening your mouth big, like this!

00:02:46.870 --> 00:02:48.330
A dream, huh?

00:02:48.580 --> 00:02:52.960
"Time Stopped at Age 12"

00:02:59.260 --> 00:03:01.470
I finally met someone--

00:03:01.470 --> 00:03:04.300
Someone who might be able to wake you up.

00:03:04.300 --> 00:03:06.850
The victim was a member
of a group of criminals

00:03:06.850 --> 00:03:09.730
responsible for a number
of murders ten years ago.

00:03:09.730 --> 00:03:12.770
He was a minor at the time,
at 16 years of age.

00:03:09.940 --> 00:03:15.320
"Hypnology" "Sleep Research"

00:03:12.770 --> 00:03:17.440
In this incident, the boys
snuck into a family's house

00:03:17.440 --> 00:03:23.200
and killed the parents and oldest daughter,
leaving only the second daughter alive.

00:03:23.200 --> 00:03:26.700
In addition, the only person to
escape danger, the second daughter,

00:03:26.700 --> 00:03:30.250
is currently afflicted with Sleeping Beauty
Syndrome and is in a comatose state.

00:03:29.200 --> 00:03:32.120
"Yo Saeki (26)"
"Unmarried Man Stabbed to Death"
"Victim was a boy involved in killing a family ten years ago"

00:03:30.250 --> 00:03:32.120
Police believe it is related to--

00:03:38.130 --> 00:03:40.630
I wonder what that dream was...

00:03:40.630 --> 00:03:42.180
There's no doubt about it.

00:03:42.180 --> 00:03:44.220
The witch killed someone.

00:03:44.220 --> 00:03:46.930
Wh-Why are you here?

00:03:46.930 --> 00:03:51.770
More importantly, what you dreamed
happened in the real world.

00:03:51.770 --> 00:03:53.650
My dream...

00:03:53.650 --> 00:03:54.860
How do you know about it?

00:03:54.860 --> 00:03:55.980
Don't worry about it.

00:03:55.980 --> 00:03:57.480
How can I not?

00:03:57.480 --> 00:03:59.190
It's fine, just listen.

00:03:59.190 --> 00:04:01.700
The witch will strike two more times.

00:04:01.700 --> 00:04:04.530
She will kill like you saw in your dream.

00:04:04.530 --> 00:04:06.740
What did you say...?

00:04:06.740 --> 00:04:08.830
It happened ten years ago...

00:04:14.750 --> 00:04:16.290
There was a family

00:04:16.290 --> 00:04:18.340
that was killed in their home.

00:04:18.340 --> 00:04:24.010
The victims were the father, the mother,
and the oldest daughter, who was 15.

00:04:24.010 --> 00:04:30.140
Her younger sister, who was 12 at the time,
hid in the closet and barely survived.

00:04:30.140 --> 00:04:33.480
But she saw everything.

00:04:33.480 --> 00:04:36.560
The culprits were arrested based
on the younger sister's testimony,

00:04:36.560 --> 00:04:38.110
but all three of them were minors.

00:04:38.110 --> 00:04:41.530
They were all boys of 16 at the time.

00:04:41.530 --> 00:04:43.990
They were not acquainted
with the victims at all,

00:04:43.990 --> 00:04:48.450
and their motive was just to shock the world.

00:04:48.450 --> 00:04:50.740
All the bones in the father's
body were broken.

00:04:50.740 --> 00:04:52.950
The mother had been hacked apart with a knife.

00:04:52.950 --> 00:04:54.160
The oldest daughter's neck was--

00:04:54.160 --> 00:04:55.670
That's enough.

00:04:55.670 --> 00:04:57.460
I don't want to imagine any more.

00:04:57.460 --> 00:04:59.840
I'm not even going into all the gory details.

00:04:59.840 --> 00:05:01.880
Whatever you say.

00:05:01.880 --> 00:05:04.380
This was a game for them.

00:05:04.380 --> 00:05:07.050
To make it look as if they were
killed because of a grudge,

00:05:07.050 --> 00:05:12.640
creating a locked-room murder
mystery for the world to solve.

00:05:12.640 --> 00:05:15.270
I remember it. I saw it on the news.

00:05:15.270 --> 00:05:20.480
The boys were all thought of as
"good boys" at home and at school.

00:05:20.480 --> 00:05:22.280
They got good grades.

00:05:22.280 --> 00:05:25.860
The main offender didn't kill anyone
but came up with the scenario for this game

00:05:25.860 --> 00:05:29.530
and told the other two
what to do at the scene.

00:05:29.530 --> 00:05:32.660
Two years ago, the three
of them reentered society.

00:05:32.660 --> 00:05:34.370
Who was killed this time?

00:05:34.370 --> 00:05:38.250
It was one of the killers.

00:05:38.250 --> 00:05:41.210
He was killed inside a locked room.

00:05:41.210 --> 00:05:43.210
So it was a locked-room murder?

00:05:43.210 --> 00:05:46.840
He was killed in the same way as the mother.

00:05:46.840 --> 00:05:49.300
There are two more of those boys.

00:05:49.300 --> 00:05:52.350
There is no doubt that
they will also be targeted.

00:05:52.350 --> 00:05:56.020
So the culprit is the younger sister
with Sleeping Beauty Syndrome?

00:05:56.020 --> 00:05:58.230
That is what I deduce.

00:05:58.230 --> 00:06:01.230
Then, it'll be faster if we wake up the sister.

00:06:01.230 --> 00:06:05.690
Those afflicted with Sleeping Beauty
Syndrome cannot be woken up.

00:06:05.690 --> 00:06:08.280
Then, it's like she's dead.

00:06:08.280 --> 00:06:11.870
Her heart is also closed to reality.

00:06:11.870 --> 00:06:15.160
However, you were able to
share a dream with the witch.

00:06:15.160 --> 00:06:18.160
That is one lead we have
to solving this crime.

00:06:18.160 --> 00:06:22.040
I'm sure <i>you</i> can reach the witch.

00:06:22.040 --> 00:06:25.050
Why did I dream the same dream as the witch?

00:06:25.050 --> 00:06:28.130
Don't you think Lily holds the key to that?

00:06:28.130 --> 00:06:30.510
I wonder...

00:06:30.510 --> 00:06:34.100
Why are you trying so hard, anyway?

00:06:34.100 --> 00:06:36.180
This has nothing to do with you, right?

00:06:36.180 --> 00:06:38.270
It <i>does</i> have something to do with me.

00:06:38.270 --> 00:06:41.190
Because you research the dream world?

00:06:41.190 --> 00:06:44.480
My younger sister also has
Sleeping Beauty Syndrome.

00:06:46.070 --> 00:06:48.030
Seriously?

00:06:48.030 --> 00:06:49.530
Here's a communicator.

00:06:49.530 --> 00:06:53.740
It'll connect me in the real world
to you in the dream world.

00:06:53.740 --> 00:06:55.410
How will that work?

00:06:55.410 --> 00:06:59.460
In the real world, I'll contact
the boys who were involved

00:06:59.460 --> 00:07:01.420
and take measures against the witch.

00:07:01.420 --> 00:07:05.920
You'll be in the dream world,
keeping the witch from killing anyone.

00:07:05.920 --> 00:07:07.300
Hey.

00:07:08.720 --> 00:07:13.970
Will the witch be charged with any crime if
she kills in the dream and it becomes reality?

00:07:13.970 --> 00:07:16.100
That is not the issue here.

00:07:16.100 --> 00:07:20.730
Even if it's for vengeance,
murder cannot be allowed.

00:07:20.730 --> 00:07:23.690
That's what it means to have morals, right?

00:07:23.690 --> 00:07:25.230
I'm counting on you.

00:07:27.980 --> 00:07:30.400
What does it mean to have morals...?

00:07:41.120 --> 00:07:43.330
Oh, it's fine.

00:07:44.420 --> 00:07:45.590
Take this.

00:07:46.670 --> 00:07:48.710
Caffeine pills?

00:07:50.420 --> 00:07:52.300
What do you want, old man?

00:07:52.300 --> 00:07:54.050
You should take that quickly.

00:07:54.050 --> 00:07:56.970
You'll be killed if you fall asleep.

00:07:56.970 --> 00:07:59.220
You know something, don't you?

00:07:59.220 --> 00:08:05.860
I'm not interested in what scumbags you are,
or whether or not you're rehabilitated.

00:08:05.860 --> 00:08:10.780
But even if it's scum that'll be killed,
if I know that there will be a murder,

00:08:10.780 --> 00:08:13.360
then I think morally, I have to stop it.

00:08:13.360 --> 00:08:16.070
Huh? I don't really get it.

00:08:16.070 --> 00:08:19.410
Tell me about the nightmares
you have been having.

00:08:31.260 --> 00:08:33.550
I'm in the witch's world.

00:08:33.550 --> 00:08:36.050
What kind of world is it?

00:08:36.050 --> 00:08:39.560
This is probably the scene of the murders.

00:08:39.560 --> 00:08:41.850
I get a bad feeling from it.

00:08:41.850 --> 00:08:43.440
It makes me irritated.

00:08:43.440 --> 00:08:46.150
It's like I'm mad and sad
and scared at the same time,

00:08:46.150 --> 00:08:49.940
and I can't really explain how I feel...

00:08:49.940 --> 00:08:51.110
You know?

00:08:51.110 --> 00:08:54.650
The witch's feelings are
taking over the dream world.

00:08:54.650 --> 00:08:56.700
Look for the witch.

00:08:56.700 --> 00:08:57.620
What about on your end?

00:08:57.620 --> 00:09:00.160
I just met them.

00:09:00.160 --> 00:09:01.160
I'm hanging up.

00:09:01.160 --> 00:09:03.250
What is it, old man?

00:09:03.250 --> 00:09:05.920
Oh, it was a call from a friend.

00:09:05.920 --> 00:09:07.170
A friend?

00:09:07.170 --> 00:09:10.340
A friend who'll keep
you guys from getting killed.

00:09:10.340 --> 00:09:13.010
Old man, you sure you're
not with the police?

00:09:13.010 --> 00:09:16.630
I mainly operate inside dreams.

00:09:16.630 --> 00:09:19.640
Don't tell me you hear voices, too?

00:09:19.640 --> 00:09:23.220
Don't worry about that. Just keep
telling me about your nightmares.

00:09:24.310 --> 00:09:27.940
Like I told you, it's the
same dream, every day.

00:09:27.940 --> 00:09:29.940
For me, too.

00:09:29.940 --> 00:09:33.400
It's always a pair of red heels.

00:09:33.400 --> 00:09:36.570
And they keep chasing me.

00:09:36.570 --> 00:09:40.700
I always get strangled.

00:09:40.700 --> 00:09:42.080
What about you?

00:09:42.080 --> 00:09:45.120
My bones are broken slowly.

00:09:45.120 --> 00:09:48.210
When I can't move anymore,
my body gets chopped to pieces.

00:09:48.210 --> 00:09:49.830
And you dream this every night?

00:09:49.830 --> 00:09:51.420
Yeah, every night.

00:09:51.420 --> 00:09:54.840
That's why I've been trying
to stay awake as much as possible.

00:09:54.840 --> 00:09:57.220
Which is why you have these, huh?

00:09:57.220 --> 00:09:59.390
Saeki was killed in his sleep, right?

00:09:59.390 --> 00:10:01.390
That appears to be the case.

00:10:01.390 --> 00:10:04.020
It's possible that the
nightmare linked to reality,

00:10:04.020 --> 00:10:07.100
resulting in a locked-room murder.

00:10:07.100 --> 00:10:12.190
The witch is completing what you all
wanted to make happen yourselves.

00:10:12.190 --> 00:10:13.440
See?

00:10:16.320 --> 00:10:17.570
Don't fall asleep.

00:10:17.570 --> 00:10:20.030
Just a little... Just five minutes...

00:10:20.030 --> 00:10:22.330
No, you can't fall asleep.

00:10:22.330 --> 00:10:24.160
Who the hell do you think you are?

00:10:24.160 --> 00:10:29.250
He's right. The way to escape
the witch is to stay awake.

00:10:29.250 --> 00:10:32.500
Once you fall asleep,
the nightmare will become reality.

00:10:32.500 --> 00:10:33.500
Bear it.

00:10:33.500 --> 00:10:35.510
I'm seriously at my limit here!

00:10:35.510 --> 00:10:38.010
It's all your fault that
it turned out like this!

00:10:38.010 --> 00:10:39.590
What, are you scared?

00:10:39.590 --> 00:10:42.850
Yeah! You're not?

00:10:42.850 --> 00:10:47.430
I'd like to meet the witch
this old man keeps talking about.

00:10:47.430 --> 00:10:49.480
I might sleep to do that.

00:10:49.480 --> 00:10:51.730
Oh, I've got a great idea.

00:10:51.730 --> 00:10:57.570
We'll go to sleep. And then,
<i>we</i> just need to kill the witch ourselves.

00:10:57.570 --> 00:10:58.820
You!

00:10:58.820 --> 00:11:00.780
I can't stay awake any longer!

00:11:02.240 --> 00:11:04.370
Is it all right to just leave him?

00:11:04.370 --> 00:11:07.000
That's not a bad idea.

00:11:07.000 --> 00:11:08.750
We'll lay our own trap.

00:11:08.750 --> 00:11:10.080
Are you serious?

00:11:29.140 --> 00:11:31.560
I came to meet you.

00:11:31.560 --> 00:11:34.360
I dreamed that you killed this guy.

00:11:34.360 --> 00:11:37.440
I wish I could've made him suffer more.

00:11:38.740 --> 00:11:41.110
Mom's throat was cut.

00:11:41.110 --> 00:11:44.200
She couldn't even scream.

00:11:44.200 --> 00:11:48.200
You're the younger sister that
survived that incident, right?

00:11:48.200 --> 00:11:49.700
Can I watch?

00:12:01.630 --> 00:12:04.680
Aw, crap. I'm totally gonna fall asleep now.

00:12:04.680 --> 00:12:06.430
Man, I'm goin' to sleep.

00:12:06.430 --> 00:12:08.930
If she's gonna come, let 'er.

00:12:08.930 --> 00:12:11.810
Who cares if she's a witch? You stupid?

00:12:23.910 --> 00:12:27.370
Is this someone who killed your family?

00:12:27.370 --> 00:12:29.410
Is the witch there?

00:12:29.410 --> 00:12:31.500
Things have gotten annoying on this end.

00:12:31.500 --> 00:12:33.710
She's right in front of me.

00:12:33.710 --> 00:12:35.250
What's the situation?

00:12:35.250 --> 00:12:38.170
She's caught something weird.
She says it's one of the perpetrators.

00:12:38.170 --> 00:12:41.300
That guy went to sleep after all, huh?

00:12:43.510 --> 00:12:44.970
Does that hurt?

00:12:44.970 --> 00:12:46.680
It hurts, doesn't it?

00:12:46.680 --> 00:12:50.560
"Help," my sister said.

00:12:50.560 --> 00:12:55.770
"Don't kill me." But these guys just smiled.

00:12:55.770 --> 00:12:58.190
I won't smile.

00:12:58.190 --> 00:13:01.150
I hated my family.

00:13:01.150 --> 00:13:03.110
I was always rebelling...

00:13:04.240 --> 00:13:07.070
That day, I died, too.

00:13:07.070 --> 00:13:11.700
The way my family died killed my heart.

00:13:13.120 --> 00:13:18.460
The three of them just happened to be
in this room, and I was in my own room.

00:13:18.460 --> 00:13:22.260
But I heard sounds and saw this...

00:13:27.180 --> 00:13:30.010
These guys were smiling.

00:13:30.010 --> 00:13:34.480
No one told them that I was there.

00:13:34.480 --> 00:13:39.400
I was protected by my dad,
my mom, and my big sister.

00:13:39.400 --> 00:13:42.980
These guys weren't tried
just because they were minors.

00:13:42.980 --> 00:13:46.990
Even though they were killers,
they were protected by the law.

00:13:46.990 --> 00:13:48.110
Why?

00:13:51.160 --> 00:13:56.750
Ever since that day, my heart
has been unable to leave this room.

00:13:56.750 --> 00:14:01.420
I've had to live with this
memory this whole time.

00:14:01.420 --> 00:14:04.090
Those guys remember smiling.

00:14:05.090 --> 00:14:07.510
But it's different for me.

00:14:11.390 --> 00:14:13.720
She got the second one!

00:14:13.720 --> 00:14:15.430
Oh really?

00:14:15.430 --> 00:14:17.390
A weird one was crushed on this side, too.

00:14:17.390 --> 00:14:19.230
What do you mean, "a weird one"?

00:14:21.650 --> 00:14:23.400
Oh.

00:14:23.400 --> 00:14:25.860
It turned into a human corpse just now.

00:14:25.860 --> 00:14:27.650
You couldn't stop her?!

00:14:27.650 --> 00:14:29.110
How could I?

00:14:29.110 --> 00:14:30.780
What...?

00:14:30.780 --> 00:14:33.580
If I stopped her, then she
wouldn't be able to leave here.

00:14:33.580 --> 00:14:35.750
Are you planning to help a killer?

00:14:35.750 --> 00:14:37.580
Well, this <i>is</i> a dream.

00:14:37.580 --> 00:14:40.170
People are dying in the real world!

00:14:40.170 --> 00:14:42.540
You met up with the perpetrators, right?

00:14:42.540 --> 00:14:43.630
Yeah.

00:14:43.630 --> 00:14:45.000
Didn't they piss you off?

00:14:45.000 --> 00:14:47.970
That has nothing to do with this.

00:14:47.970 --> 00:14:51.760
I... like this witch.

00:14:51.760 --> 00:14:53.600
She's amazing.

00:14:53.600 --> 00:14:57.640
I didn't realize you could use
the dream world in this way.

00:14:59.270 --> 00:15:02.480
Listen, the effect dreams
have on reality is--

00:15:02.480 --> 00:15:04.690
You're a boring guy.

00:15:08.530 --> 00:15:11.030
There's only one more left. Finish him.

00:15:13.120 --> 00:15:14.990
I'm boring?

00:15:19.870 --> 00:15:25.210
They pissed me off, but if people
realize you can kill in dreams,

00:15:25.210 --> 00:15:26.920
then everyone would start doing it.

00:15:30.300 --> 00:15:32.050
A nightcap, please.

00:15:33.680 --> 00:15:34.970
Hey.

00:15:36.260 --> 00:15:41.890
This is a dream, but it does mean
that you've also killed someone.

00:15:41.890 --> 00:15:44.310
I want to know more about you.

00:15:47.570 --> 00:15:50.440
It's fine if you don't want to talk, though.

00:15:52.360 --> 00:15:55.240
It was my dream to do this.

00:15:56.330 --> 00:15:58.490
For revenge?

00:15:58.490 --> 00:16:04.290
Until that day, I didn't have anything...

00:16:04.290 --> 00:16:07.040
My family was annoying.

00:16:07.040 --> 00:16:11.010
All the adults went on about
having dreams or hope,

00:16:11.010 --> 00:16:14.930
but honestly, I didn't think
I needed that stuff.

00:16:14.930 --> 00:16:18.100
I mean, I was fine the way I was.

00:16:19.810 --> 00:16:22.230
But that day...

00:16:24.190 --> 00:16:27.690
After that happened, I dreamed...

00:16:27.690 --> 00:16:29.570
...to kill these guys.

00:16:29.570 --> 00:16:30.820
To make them feel pain.

00:16:30.820 --> 00:16:35.490
To make them feel hundreds of times
the pain my family felt, and then kill them.

00:16:35.490 --> 00:16:39.330
Then, I would feel like I was alive.

00:16:39.330 --> 00:16:43.330
That dream's over once you kill
all three of them, though.

00:16:43.330 --> 00:16:44.790
Your dream will end.

00:16:44.790 --> 00:16:46.540
What'll you do after that?

00:16:46.540 --> 00:16:49.090
It doesn't matter.

00:16:49.090 --> 00:16:52.340
If I don't kill them, I can't live.

00:16:56.340 --> 00:16:57.550
You...

00:16:58.550 --> 00:17:01.430
What about them?

00:17:01.430 --> 00:17:04.140
Damn. You're amazing.

00:17:04.140 --> 00:17:06.730
You can do amazing stuff like this.

00:17:06.730 --> 00:17:09.770
I mean, you're cool. I honestly think that.

00:17:18.530 --> 00:17:20.280
The third guy, huh?

00:17:20.280 --> 00:17:23.580
This one didn't do anything himself.

00:17:26.370 --> 00:17:29.290
He's the one I wanted to kill the most.

00:17:38.840 --> 00:17:40.760
I wanted to meet you.

00:17:40.760 --> 00:17:46.440
The world changes after you
kill someone, doesn't it?

00:17:46.440 --> 00:17:48.440
It was like that for us, too.

00:17:48.440 --> 00:17:52.150
But you came up with something
pretty interesting, too, huh?

00:17:52.150 --> 00:17:56.990
To kill people using dreams. That's amazing!

00:17:56.990 --> 00:17:59.660
You can commit the perfect crime.

00:17:59.660 --> 00:18:02.790
How did you become able to do this?

00:18:02.790 --> 00:18:05.250
Come on, tell me.

00:18:05.250 --> 00:18:06.460
What the hell?

00:18:06.460 --> 00:18:08.830
Who are you?

00:18:08.830 --> 00:18:10.540
Don't worry about it.

00:18:10.540 --> 00:18:12.670
Are you her boyfriend?

00:18:12.670 --> 00:18:16.880
Don't tell me you also did something
to her and were dragged into this?

00:18:16.880 --> 00:18:18.260
Idiot.

00:18:18.260 --> 00:18:22.510
Then, why don't you finish off
this witch with me?

00:18:27.310 --> 00:18:29.980
I hope you don't misunderstand, though.

00:18:29.980 --> 00:18:32.400
These two were the ones who killed them.

00:18:32.400 --> 00:18:36.820
I'm less guilty than these two, you know.

00:18:36.820 --> 00:18:42.740
I don't understand why you'd
want to kill me the most.

00:18:42.740 --> 00:18:44.450
You smiled.

00:18:44.450 --> 00:18:46.160
You just kept smiling.

00:18:46.160 --> 00:18:47.500
You're smiling now, too.

00:18:47.500 --> 00:18:51.290
I wanna try doing what you're doing, though...

00:18:51.290 --> 00:18:52.670
Is it like this?

00:18:56.090 --> 00:18:58.130
Hah! I did it!

00:18:58.130 --> 00:19:02.090
It's easy! Whatever you think happens, huh?

00:19:02.090 --> 00:19:04.640
This place is the best!

00:19:04.640 --> 00:19:06.810
I'm gonna do what I want to do.

00:19:06.810 --> 00:19:10.270
I'm famous on the internet, you know.

00:19:15.860 --> 00:19:17.940
You're pissing me off.

00:19:20.740 --> 00:19:22.910
She's strong, you know.

00:19:22.910 --> 00:19:25.790
She's way more amazing
than someone like you.

00:19:25.790 --> 00:19:29.160
That's why I'll take her side.

00:19:29.160 --> 00:19:31.000
Does that hurt? Huh?!

00:19:31.000 --> 00:19:33.710
It hurts, doesn't it?

00:19:33.710 --> 00:19:35.340
I'll do it.

00:20:13.790 --> 00:20:15.670
Are you okay?

00:20:15.670 --> 00:20:18.550
The dream ended, huh?

00:20:18.550 --> 00:20:22.430
I have a new dream now...

00:20:24.260 --> 00:20:25.890
Thank you.

00:20:51.450 --> 00:20:55.170
Once I'm out of bed, I want to meet you.

00:21:07.470 --> 00:21:09.180
Welcome back.

00:21:09.180 --> 00:21:12.890
Are you the one who showed
me that witch's dream?

00:21:12.890 --> 00:21:15.730
No, it wasn't me.

00:21:15.730 --> 00:21:18.610
What? Do you know who did?

00:21:18.610 --> 00:21:26.200
No, but I think someone is trying
to tell you something, Brother.

00:21:26.200 --> 00:21:29.660
I wonder if I'll dream
someone else's dream again...

00:21:29.660 --> 00:21:31.910
I don't know, but...

00:21:31.910 --> 00:21:36.870
Oh, well, I'm tired. Let me sleep.

00:21:36.870 --> 00:21:38.460
You killed someone?

00:21:38.460 --> 00:21:40.590
Yeah.

00:21:40.590 --> 00:21:42.420
But not the witch.

00:21:44.550 --> 00:21:46.430
Yurina...

00:21:46.430 --> 00:21:49.350
What dream are you having...?

00:23:26.820 --> 00:23:33.160
If the world ends tomorrow, is there
someone you want to tell your feelings to?

00:23:33.160 --> 00:23:35.530
There is, baa!

00:23:34.240 --> 00:23:39.910
"The Witch of First Love"

00:23:35.530 --> 00:23:39.910
Next time's dream is
"The Witch of First Love."
